{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/guohu7777/jsonEdit/pull/11","repo":"guohu7777/jsonEdit","number":11,"set":"agent","source":"devin","title":"feat: 文件字段视频预览——行内缩略图点击弹出 Modal 播放器","body":"## Summary\n\n文件字段新增视频预览：URL 为视频时在字段行显示一个静音缩略图（带 ▶ 角标），点击弹出居中的 Modal，内嵌 `<video controls autoPlay>` 播放器可直接播放。\n\n判定规则（`FileEditor`）：`mediaHint === 'video'` 或 URL 命中 `VIDEO_RE`（mp4/webm/mov/mkv/avi/m4v/mpg/mpeg）→ 视频预览；否则按 `IMAGE_RE`/`mediaHint === 'image'` 走图片缩略图。`ValueEditor` 新增可选 `mediaHint` 属性，`ResourceList` 按条目的 `type` 字段传入 —— 所以 `type: \"video\"` 的资源即使 URL 没有扩展名也会显示视频预览；通用树里的 file 字段不变，仍按扩展名判断。\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- `tsc -b --noEmit`、`electron-vite build` 通过\n- 视觉验证：MP4 URL 行内出现缩略图 → 点击 → Modal 播放器可播放；图片预览行为不变\n\n## Notes\n\n- 预览依赖 `webSecurity: false`（`file://` 本地回退 URL 也需要播放器能加载），与现有图片预览同一约束\n- Modal 的 `destroyOnHidden` 保证关闭即卸载 `<video>`，不会后台继续占带宽\n\n\nLink to Devin session: https://app.devin.ai/sessions/ad704608b2324cd3b35fc75a45f95219\nOpen in Devin Desktop: https://app.devin.ai/desktop/session/ad704608b2324cd3b35fc75a45f95219?variant=devin\nRequested by: @guohu7777\n<!-- devin-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://app.devin.ai/review/guohu7777/jsonedit/pull/11\" target=\"_blank\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-devin-review-dark.svg?v=4\"><img src=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-devin-review-light.svg?v=4\" alt=\"Devin Review\"></picture></a>\n<!-- devin-review-badge-end -->","authorType":"Bot","additions":77,"deletions":7,"changedFiles":3,"files":[{"path":"src/components/ResourceList.tsx","additions":7,"deletions":0},{"path":"src/components/ValueEditor.tsx","additions":44,"deletions":7},{"path":"src/styles.css","additions":26,"deletions":0}],"template":null}